RawSchedule.description:
Manifest `schedule` block — declares the connector's default update
strategy. Several shapes are accepted (validated in
[`crate::ParsedSchedule::from_raw`]):

- legacy `{ "interval": 600 }` (shorthand for an interval schedule);
- `{ "strategy": "manual" }`;
- `{ "strategy": "interval", "interval_seconds": 600 }`;
- `{ "strategy": "daily", "time": "09:00" }`.

Absent `schedule` keeps the default interval behavior.
